<title>GERMANY: German April M3 due shortly - Bundesbank.</title>
<headline>German April M3 due shortly - Bundesbank.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said it will release M3 money supply data for the month of April shortly.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
